    "note": "Layout: status (i16), severity (i16), stamp (epicsTimeStamp {secPastEpoch u32, nsec u32}), value (char[40] NUL-padded). No RISC_pad. EPICS timestamps count from the EPICS epoch 1990-01-01, not the Unix epoch. stamp = {1000000000, 500000000} = {0x3B9ACA00, 0x1DCD6500}. Per epics-base modules/ca/src/client/db_access.h. Hand-authored anchor, machine-verified against real EPICS in 0c-3."
